    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><i>Blazing Hot High-speed Meteor Action in Chaotic Space!</i><br><br>METEORA is Inspired by the imagined Universes of classic space movies and science documentaries. Set billions of years ago, in an agitated, nascent universe; you are a meteor fighting for survival in a violently changing world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manoeuvre your way through asteroid belts, meteor barrages and other space events</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.poster.avif?t=1750774667\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.webm?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.mp4?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dodge, Chase &amp; Plan Your Take-Downs</h2>Death is a constant looming threat - watch the rear view markers and dodge the other meteors closing in behind you, while chasing the ones ahead and setting yourself up to take them down.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create and Customize your own Meteor shower</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.poster.avif?t=1750774667\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.webm?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.mp4?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Possess &amp; create your own meteor shower to destroy your opponents all at once! Players can customize their meteor shower formation to maximise the damage and increase their chances of survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock, upgrade, combine power-ups &amp; Abilities to survive and conquer along your journey</h2>Use various power-ups obtained by dashing into power-up elements out in space. Strategize your power-up pick-ups and combine them in real-time to get an edge over the opponents seeking to destroy you!.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience A Fraction of the Universe Each Level</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.poster.avif?t=1750774667\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.webm?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.mp4?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Put your skills and instincts to test with harder difficulties and unlock hidden boss-challenges.<br><br>Brave a supermassive black hole, destroy a planet, save a sun and much more as you experience this catalytic universe. <br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the Beginning of the Universe</strong></h2></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Blazing Hot High-speed Meteor Action in Chaotic Space!</i><br><br>METEORA is Inspired by the imagined Universes of classic space movies and science documentaries. Set billions of years ago, in an agitated, nascent universe; you are a meteor fighting for survival in a violently changing world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manoeuvre your way through asteroid belts, meteor barrages and other space events</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.poster.avif?t=1750774667\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.webm?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/5afed852bea570cdc16bd2f4fd98a2eb.mp4?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dodge, Chase &amp; Plan Your Take-Downs</h2>Death is a constant looming threat - watch the rear view markers and dodge the other meteors closing in behind you, while chasing the ones ahead and setting yourself up to take them down.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create and Customize your own Meteor shower</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.poster.avif?t=1750774667\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.webm?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/49a094f59dc0594d9142c3ebece91ad3.mp4?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Possess &amp; create your own meteor shower to destroy your opponents all at once! Players can customize their meteor shower formation to maximise the damage and increase their chances of survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock, upgrade, combine power-ups &amp; Abilities to survive and conquer along your journey</h2>Use various power-ups obtained by dashing into power-up elements out in space. Strategize your power-up pick-ups and combine them in real-time to get an edge over the opponents seeking to destroy you!.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Experience A Fraction of the Universe Each Level</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.poster.avif?t=1750774667\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.webm?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1155220/extras/10d2b92e6543bb88fb3c8c3544ff56ba.mp4?t=1750774667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Put your skills and instincts to test with harder difficulties and unlock hidden boss-challenges.<br><br>Brave a supermassive black hole, destroy a planet, save a sun and much more as you experience this catalytic universe. <br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the Beginning of the Universe</strong></h2></strong>",
    "short_description": "BE A METEOR in a constant race for survival in a young and chaotic universe by dodging, chasing &amp; taking down other meteors in METEORA. Power up, strategize and put your skills to the test in our spectacular arcade combat racer!",
